<#-- The body of a request for quotation email (mantle.order.SourcingServices.send#QuoteRequest): the buyer's note, then the
     RFQ as printed by get#QuoteRequestPrint, whose PDF is attached; with
     linkUrl, the supplier's own link to the Supplier app (impl-purchasing P16). -->
<#if note><div style="font:11pt Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:16px">
<#list String(note).split('\n') as noteLine>${noteLine}<br></#list>
</div></#if>
<#if linkUrl><p style="font:11pt Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:16px"><a href="${linkUrl}">Open this link</a> to answer this request with your quote.
The link is yours alone; do not forward it.</p></#if>
${raw(printHtml)}
